        "title": "Restore one path and verify",
        "instruction": "In Grid operations inspect a Hasle circuit, close one circuit onto the dead switchyard using its supported control, and advance a small interval if needed. Check current energisation and station-service import; a closed breaker alone is not proof. This gate observes Unit 1 offsite energisation true. Finish the remaining circuits only after inspecting each synchro-check result.",
